   "start_page": 9,
   "summary": "This six-page register (Sheets 1 through 6 of File 894.20 M.I.D.) catalogs intelligence reports prepared by the Military Intelligence Division (MID) and U.S. Military Attachés between July 1930 and December 1939. The listed reports encompass combat estimates of Japanese armed forces, analyses of Japan's national defense system, annual army budgets, and industrial mobilization legislation. A major component of the listing comprises extensive 'Who's Who in the Army' biographical sketches of high-ranking Japanese generals and commanders, accompanied by periodic summaries of field operations in China and overseas troop deployments.",
   "title": "List of Papers: Military Intelligence Division Reports on Military Affairs in Japan (File 894.20 M.I.D., Sub-numbers 3–107)",
